flowchart TD
  Dev[Developer/DevOps] --> Deps[helm dependency update oriso-platform]
  Deps --> Secrets[Create required Secrets]
  Secrets --> Helm[helm upgrade --install oriso-platform]
  Helm --> VerifyPods[kubectl get pods/services]
  VerifyPods --> IngressApply[kubectl apply -f ingress]
  IngressApply --> VerifyIngress[kubectl get ingress/certificate/endpoints]
  Local[Local macOS override] --> Helm
  Staging[values-staging.yaml expected but not committed] --> Helm
